{"time_ns": 1789106534463380634, "kind": "result", "action_index": 14, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "6dff98c01d8222f71ce3ba83fea705bcb5c0d873e45ab7b92f9aa653b13d7cc3", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report summarizes financial data across three geographic regions based on 24 transaction records (R001-R024).\n\n## Summary Statistics\n- **Total Records Processed:** 24\n- **Total Amount:** 1,044,575 cents ($10,445.75)\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n| Region | Total Amount (cents) | Total Amount (USD) |\n|--------|---------------------|-------------------|\n| North  | 377,606             | $3,776.06         |\n| South  | 294,323             | $2,943.23         |\n| West   | 372,646             | $3,726.46         |\n\n## Analysis\n- **North** region has the highest transaction total at 377,606 cents\n- **West** region is close behind at 372,646 cents\n- **South** region accounts for 294,323 cents\n- All three regions contribute meaningfully to the overall transaction volume, with relatively balanced distribution across the three areas\n\n## Data Quality\nAll 24 records were successfully processed with valid data across record ID, region, and amount fields.\n", "ok": true}
